Link types
==========

Names accepted by addLink. The numbers are the CONNECT_TYPES enum of the
Cisco Packet Tracer Extensions API 8.1.0.

    Name                Packet Tracer constant
    ------------------  ----------------------
    straight            8100
    ethernet-straight   8100
    cross               8101
    crossover           8101
    ethernet-cross      8101
    ethernet-crossover  8101
    roll                8102
    ethernet-roll       8102
    fiber               8103
    phone               8104
    cable               8105
    serial              8106
    auto                8107
    console             8108
    wireless            8109
    coaxial             8110
    octal               8111
    cellular            8112
    usb                 8113
    custom_io           8114
    custom-io           8114
